## Container padding

The container takes a padding on every side, a padding per axis, or both. An axis value wins over
`padding`, and `padding` wins over the platform default of 64px.

Terraform owns all three. A value you configure is written, `0` included, and an axis you leave out
of the configuration clears whatever override is stored against the tenant on the next apply.

